### get contacts bez tokena
GET http://localhost:5073/api/contacts
Accept: application/json

### login
POST http://localhost:5073/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "sales@crm.local",
  "password": "Sales@123!"
}

### get contacts token
GET http://localhost:5073/api/contacts
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.._E1MkOV8si5g5gOQkPaWH0X1_3iULao9omWV6KN5IGQ


