### 2.Dodaj kontakt typu Person
POST {{WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/contacts/poly
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..TQ74a7z3RfzfT3fqAyZGP-KbteFp3x1tZ34gjAJH95g

{
  "contactType": "Person",
  "firstName": "Jan",
  "lastName": "Kowalski",
  "email": "jan.kowalski@demo.pl",
  "phone": "48123456789",
  "gender": "Male",
  "position": "Dyrektor"
}

### 3.Dodaj kontakt typu Company
POST {{WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/contacts/poly
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..TQ74a7z3RfzfT3fqAyZGP-KbteFp3x1tZ34gjAJH95g

{
  "contactType": "Company",
  "name": "Acme Corp",
  "email": "contact@acme.pl",
  "phone": "48123000000",
  "nip": "1234567890",
  "industry": "IT",
  "website": "https://acme.pl"
}

